Subject: [PATCH 13/19] NUNBOX32 big-endian: payload address for raw
 pointer/int32 loads of Value slots (ValuePayloadAddress); 64-bit atomics via
 libatomic on ppc32

---
 js/src/jit/BaselineCacheIRCompiler.cpp        |  3 ++-
 js/src/jit/CacheIRCompiler.cpp                | 19 ++++++++++++++-----
 js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp                  | 16 +++++++++++-----
